target: internal/push/push.go
verify: go test ./internal/push/ -count=1 -run 'TestReportLandedRefusesATraversingRunID'
expect: no marker satisfied an invalid run id
why:    reportProbe must stop when evidence.Marker refuses the id. Past that point the marker needle is "", which every string contains, so a PR comment carrying only the fingerprint satisfies the gate for an id that names nothing. The pending-file path still fails closed on its own (PendingPath refuses too), which is why only the PR-comment path can catch this.
--- old
	marker, ok := evidence.Marker(runID)
	if !ok {
--- new
